  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:92368",
  "description": "The curl packages provide the libcurl library and the curl utility for downloading files from servers using various protocols, including HTTP, FTP, and LDAP.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * libcurl: libcurl: Security feature bypass due to improper mTLS connection reuse (CVE-2026-8932)\n  * curl: libcurl: Unauthorized connection reuse due to a logical error (CVE-2026-8458)\n  * curl: curl: Cookie injection via malicious HTTP server using super cookies (CVE-2026-8924)\n  * curl: curl: Information disclosure via incorrect Digest authentication header reuse (CVE-2026-11856)\n  * curl: Information disclosure due to uncleared proxy authentication state (CVE-2026-8927)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Backport upstream curl PR #6852 (\"h2: allow 100 streams by default\") to AlmaLinux 8 libcurl (JIRA:RHEL-232829)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
  "fromstr": "packager@almalinux.org",
